<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1854812733"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:18.627"><div begin="45.338" end="1:15.514" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="45.338" end="51.960" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.338" end="45.824">写信</span><span begin="45.824" end="46.508">告诉</span><span begin="46.508" end="46.920">我</span><span begin="47.242" end="48.237">今天</span><span begin="48.649" end="49.951">海是什么</span><span begin="49.951" end="50.536">颜</span><span begin="50.536" end="51.960">色</span></p><p begin="53.067" end="1:00.128" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.067" end="53.558">夜夜</span><span begin="53.558" end="54.191">陪着</span><span begin="54.191" end="54.911">你</span><span begin="54.911" end="55.902">的海</span><span begin="56.317" end="57.464">心情又</span><span begin="57.464" end="58.208">如</span><span begin="58.208" end="1:00.128">何</span></p><p begin="1:00.366" end="1:06.805" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.366" end="1:01.165">灰色是</span><span begin="1:01.165" end="1:02.067">不想</span><span begin="1:02.067" end="1:03.170">说</span> <span begin="1:03.793" end="1:04.797">蓝色是</span><span begin="1:04.797" end="1:05.256">忧</span><span begin="1:05.256" end="1:06.805">郁</span></p><p begin="1:07.730" end="1:15.514" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.730" end="1:08.876">而漂泊的</span><span begin="1:08.876" end="1:09.449">你</span> <span begin="1:09.850" end="1:10.921">狂浪的</span><span begin="1:10.921" end="1:11.385">心</span> <span begin="1:11.777" end="1:13.278">停在哪</span><span begin="1:13.278" end="1:15.514">里</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.260" end="1:46.907" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:16.260" end="1:22.545" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.260" end="1:16.746">写信</span><span begin="1:16.746" end="1:17.430">告诉</span><span begin="1:17.430" end="1:17.842">我</span><span begin="1:18.164" end="1:19.159">今夜</span><span begin="1:19.571" end="1:21.029">你想要梦</span><span begin="1:21.029" end="1:21.458">什</span><span begin="1:21.458" end="1:22.545">么</span></p><p begin="1:24.033" end="1:31.089" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.033" end="1:24.467">梦里</span><span begin="1:24.467" end="1:24.901">外</span><span begin="1:24.901" end="1:25.760">的我</span><span begin="1:25.760" end="1:26.710">是否</span><span begin="1:27.285" end="1:28.355">都让你</span><span begin="1:28.355" end="1:29.459">无从</span><span begin="1:29.459" end="1:29.853">选</span><span begin="1:29.853" end="1:31.089">择</span></p><p begin="1:31.387" end="1:38.625" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.387" end="1:32.218">我揪着</span><span begin="1:32.218" end="1:33.058">一颗</span><span begin="1:33.058" end="1:34.047">心</span> <span begin="1:35.100" end="1:35.967">整夜都</span><span begin="1:35.967" end="1:37.374">闭不了</span><span begin="1:37.374" end="1:38.625">眼睛</span></p><p begin="1:39.110" end="1:46.907" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.110" end="1:39.819">为何你</span><span begin="1:39.819" end="1:40.764">明明</span><span begin="1:40.966" end="1:42.228">动了情</span> <span begin="1:42.834" end="1:43.794">却又不</span><span begin="1:43.794" end="1:44.589">靠</span><span begin="1:44.589" end="1:46.907">近</span></p></div><div begin="1:47.789" end="2:50.351" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:47.789" end="1:54.193" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.789" end="1:49.965">听</span> <span begin="1:50.453" end="1:51.385">海哭的</span><span begin="1:51.385" end="1:51.760">声</span><span begin="1:51.760" end="1:54.193">音</span></p><p begin="1:54.585" end="2:03.073" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.585" end="1:55.471">叹惜着</span><span begin="1:55.471" end="1:56.455">谁又被</span><span begin="1:56.455" end="1:57.244">伤了</span><span begin="1:57.244" end="1:57.904">心</span> <span begin="1:58.152" end="1:59.299">却还不清</span><span begin="1:59.299" end="2:03.073">醒</span></p><p begin="2:03.713" end="2:09.934" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.713" end="2:04.211">一定</span><span begin="2:04.211" end="2:04.872">不是</span><span begin="2:04.872" end="2:05.787">我</span> <span begin="2:06.069" end="2:07.009">至少</span><span begin="2:07.009" end="2:08.046">我很冷</span><span begin="2:08.046" end="2:09.934">静</span></p><p begin="2:10.042" end="2:18.457" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.042" end="2:11.049">可是泪</span><span begin="2:11.049" end="2:11.553">水</span> <span begin="2:11.900" end="2:12.837">就连泪</span><span begin="2:12.837" end="2:13.305">水</span><span begin="2:13.644" end="2:14.604">也都不</span><span begin="2:14.604" end="2:15.179">相</span><span begin="2:15.179" end="2:18.457">信</span></p><p begin="2:18.780" end="2:25.184" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.780" end="2:20.956">听</span> <span begin="2:21.444" end="2:22.376">海哭的</span><span begin="2:22.376" end="2:22.751">声</span><span begin="2:22.751" end="2:25.184">音</span></p><p begin="2:25.514" end="2:34.262" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.514" end="2:26.460">这片海</span><span begin="2:26.460" end="2:27.444">未免也</span><span begin="2:27.444" end="2:28.862">太多情</span> <span begin="2:29.235" end="2:29.719">悲泣</span><span begin="2:29.719" end="2:30.089">到</span><span begin="2:30.089" end="2:30.445">天</span><span begin="2:30.445" end="2:34.262">明</span></p><p begin="2:34.717" end="2:40.798" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.717" end="2:35.184">写封</span><span begin="2:35.184" end="2:35.650">信</span><span begin="2:35.650" end="2:36.583">给我</span> <span begin="2:37.017" end="2:38.005">就当</span><span begin="2:38.005" end="2:39.122">最后约</span><span begin="2:39.122" end="2:40.798">定</span></p><p begin="2:40.929" end="2:50.351" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.929" end="2:41.786">说你在</span><span begin="2:41.786" end="2:43.274">离开我的</span><span begin="2:43.274" end="2:44.193">时候</span><span begin="2:44.712" end="2:46.200">是怎样</span><span begin="2:46.200" end="2:46.600">的</span><span begin="2:46.600" end="2:47.239">心</span><span begin="2:47.239" end="2:50.351">情</span></p></div><div begin="3:16.312" end="3:46.960" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="3:16.312" end="3:22.597" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.312" end="3:16.798">写信</span><span begin="3:16.798" end="3:17.482">告诉</span><span begin="3:17.482" end="3:17.894">我</span><span begin="3:18.216" end="3:19.211">今夜</span><span begin="3:19.623" end="3:21.081">你想要梦</span><span begin="3:21.081" end="3:21.510">什</span><span begin="3:21.510" end="3:22.597">么</span></p><p begin="3:24.162" end="3:31.218" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.162" end="3:24.596">梦里</span><span begin="3:24.596" end="3:25.030">外</span><span begin="3:25.030" end="3:25.889">的我</span><span begin="3:25.889" end="3:26.839">是否</span><span begin="3:27.414" end="3:28.484">都让你</span><span begin="3:28.484" end="3:29.588">无从</span><span begin="3:29.588" end="3:29.982">选</span><span begin="3:29.982" end="3:31.218">择</span></p><p begin="3:31.431" end="3:38.669" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:31.431" end="3:32.262">我揪着</span><span begin="3:32.262" end="3:33.093">一颗</span><span begin="3:33.093" end="3:34.091">心</span> <span begin="3:35.144" end="3:36.011">整夜都</span><span begin="3:36.011" end="3:37.418">闭不了</span><span begin="3:37.418" end="3:38.669">眼睛</span></p><p begin="3:39.163" end="3:46.960" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:39.163" end="3:39.872">为何你</span><span begin="3:39.872" end="3:40.817">明明</span><span begin="3:41.019" end="3:42.281">动了情</span> <span begin="3:42.887" end="3:43.847">却又不</span><span begin="3:43.847" end="3:44.642">靠</span><span begin="3:44.642" end="3:46.960">近</span></p></div><div begin="3:47.883" end="4:50.943" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="3:47.883" end="3:54.287" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:47.883" end="3:50.059">听</span> <span begin="3:50.547" end="3:51.479">海哭的</span><span begin="3:51.479" end="3:51.854">声</span><span begin="3:51.854" end="3:54.287">音</span><